    [CI] Revert AISBench update from #17086 (#18201)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Reverts #17086 (commit `efc5bcb0a`). Restores the previous AISBench tags
    and removes `requirements/response_anomaly.txt` from nightly CI and
    multi-node test installation commands.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. The affected files configure nightly testing and document multi-node
    testing.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - `git diff --cached --check` passed before commit.
    - The reverted files match their state before #17086 (`git diff
    --exit-code efc5bcb0a^ -- <seven changed files>`).
    - Both changed workflow YAML files parsed with PyYAML.
    - NPU nightly builds were not run locally; CI should validate them.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607

